# =============================================================================
# CAUSAL VOLATILITY
# =============================================================================
#
# Weekly log return:
#
#     r_t = log(P_t) - log(P_(t-1))
#
# Rolling volatility:
#
#     std(r_(t-N+1) ... r_t)
#
# This is completely causal.
#
# No information after date t is used.
#
# We calculate:
#
#     10-week volatility
#     20-week volatility
#     52-week volatility
#
# and their first differences.
#
# =============================================================================

print("\n" + "=" * 80)
